  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased capacity of the constituents to design, implement and monitor integrated policy frameworks for a conducive environment for sustainable enterprises</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The following are the major global deliverables and activities of the ILO in this policy area: 

&#x2022; Development of a SME Test toolkit to support ILO constituents in assessing new legislation and policies from a MSME perspective. 
&#x2022; Conduct policy research and policy briefs to provide new evidence on policy alternatives for an improved enabling environment and to better document what successful MSME policies for productive, green and decent work are.
&#x2022; Develop a new approach and tools to provide practical guidance to ILO constituents in developing, implementing and monitoring MSME policies for productive and decent work.</narrative>
  </description>
